  /* ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     CAELUS UNIVERSAL DATA NETWORK (EVRENSEL VERİ AĞI)
     - Multi-sector, user-controlled, opt-in connector catalog & parsers:
       1. WEATHER_MARINE: Open-Meteo Weather & Marine API (WMO / ECMWF / MFWAM)
       2. ENVIRONMENT_SEISMIC: USGS Earthquake Hazards Program GeoJSON API (FDSNWS v1)
       3. ECONOMY_MACRO: World Bank Open Data API v2 & ECB Frankfurter Reference Rates
       4. GEO_SPACE: Open-Meteo Geocoding / Elevation API & JPL J2000.0 Ephemeris
       5. SYSTEM_TELEMETRY: Win32 Local Host Telemetry (/api/telemetry)
       6. CUSTOM_AUTHORIZED: User-Defined Authorized HTTP/HTTPS JSON & LAN Sources
       7. PLANNED_EXTENSIBLE: Explicitly labeled planned enterprise connectors
          (AIS Maritime Stream, HL7/FHIR Hospital Gateway, ENTSO-E Grid API)
     ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

